<title>UK: Rheinhyp sets $750 mln 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinhyp sets $750 mln 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following dollar global pfandbrief bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $750 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    18.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    18.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+23-24 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC   1.625</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR UST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
